==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-keep an eye out.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|keep<,,kept> an eye out}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[watch]] for or [[look out]] for.
#: ''I think we're getting close, so '''keep an eye out''' for the next street.''

====Usage notes====
* Usually followed by a preposition phrase beginning with [[for]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|keep an eye peeled}}

